[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7870.55, "timestamp": "02:11:10", "text": "的。我們chuba。啊，是的。是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7874.87, "timestamp": "02:11:14", "text": "。  就是這樣。  我經常使用重音符號"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7884.87, "timestamp": "02:11:24", "text": "。我不明白"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7886.87, "timestamp": "02:11:26", "text": "為什麼人們喜歡"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7893.27, "timestamp": "02:11:33", "text": "指出"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7894.629, "timestamp": "02:11:34", "text": "「哦，這個人有口音」好像是件"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7897.189, "timestamp": "02:11:37", "text": "壞事一樣，因為我看到這種情況大多發生在印度人身上。  我經常在印度人身上看到這種情況，尤其是當"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7903.27, "timestamp": "02:11:43", "text": "你使用口音的時候。  就好像在說：「哦，你以為你比我們強"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7905.91, "timestamp": "02:11:45", "text": "？你在炫耀吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7918.55, "timestamp": "02:11:58", "text": "。」就像剛才有人"}]